  "limits": "Native nucleacond and kinetic primitives; source subeffmode=0 ramp composed with native calls. Original FP64 geometry cancellation and contact-case-1 subsaturated NaNs are recorded. Binary128 only resolves the geometric cancellation; it does not change the source equations. Empty bins use zero weight; dry vapor uses saturation pressure directly. The shared implicit root removes the native 1e-8 stopping noise. Previous effective input uses seeded history with native substeps; the released driver never fills its dust-history arrays. The port saves pre-cloud dust alongside source pre-cloud Q and post-cloud T. Outer sedimentation and long climate validation remain separate."
